<div class="mb-12" data-reveal>
  <h2 class="mb-5 text-[26px] font-semibold leading-[1.2] tracking-tight text-[#111827] md:text-[30px]">About CMS Group</h2>
  <p class="text-[16px] leading-relaxed text-[#6B7280] md:text-[17px]">
    <strong class="font-semibold text-[#111827]">CMS Group</strong> processes a high volume of documents as part of its enterprise operations &mdash; contracts, invoices, compliance forms, and internal records moving between teams every day. Most of that volume used to require manual review and routing.
  </p>
</div>

<div class="mb-12" data-reveal>
  <h2 class="mb-4 text-[26px] font-semibold leading-[1.2] tracking-tight text-[#111827] md:text-[30px]">The challenge</h2>
  <p class="mb-5 text-[16px] leading-relaxed text-[#6B7280] md:text-[17px]">
    Every document that came in had to be manually read, classified, and routed to the right team. As volume grew, this became a bottleneck &mdash; staff spent hours on repetitive classification and data entry instead of higher-value work.
  </p>
  <div class="rounded-2xl border border-red-200 bg-red-50 p-6">
    <p class="mb-2 font-medium text-[#111827]">Key pain points:</p>
    <ul class="space-y-2 text-[14px] leading-relaxed text-[#6B7280]">
      <li>&bull; Manual document classification consumed hours of staff time daily</li>
      <li>&bull; Routing errors caused delays between teams</li>
      <li>&bull; No centralized visibility into document status</li>
      <li>&bull; Onboarding new staff to the process took weeks</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="mb-12" data-reveal>
  <h2 class="mb-4 text-[26px] font-semibold leading-[1.2] tracking-tight text-[#111827] md:text-[30px]">The solution</h2>
  <p class="mb-5 text-[16px] leading-relaxed text-[#6B7280] md:text-[17px]">
    CMS Group deployed Zunkiree's AI systems to classify incoming documents automatically, extract the relevant data, and route each one to the right team without manual intervention. Staff now review exceptions instead of processing every document by hand.
  </p>
  <div class="space-y-3">
    <div class="rounded-2xl border border-navy-100/60 bg-white p-5 shadow-subtle">
      <p class="mb-1 font-medium text-[#111827]">Automated classification</p>
      <p class="text-[13.5px] text-[#6B7280]">Incoming documents are read and categorized automatically, without a person opening each one first.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="rounded-2xl border border-navy-100/60 bg-white p-5 shadow-subtle">
      <p class="mb-1 font-medium text-[#111827]">Structured data extraction</p>
      <p class="text-[13.5px] text-[#6B7280]">Key fields are pulled directly into downstream systems instead of being typed in manually.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="rounded-2xl border border-navy-100/60 bg-white p-5 shadow-subtle">
      <p class="mb-1 font-medium text-[#111827]">Exception-based review</p>
      <p class="text-[13.5px] text-[#6B7280]">Staff attention is reserved for documents the system flags as unusual, not the routine majority.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="mb-12" data-reveal>
  <h2 class="mb-4 text-[26px] font-semibold leading-[1.2] tracking-tight text-[#111827] md:text-[30px]">The results</h2>
